105 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 42 0 R/E(At Palm River Academy, we empower students to discover their strengths, pursue their interests, and build essential life skills. We provide a safe, supportive, and inspiring environment where students gain confidence in their learning and self-discovery. Our goal is to develop independent, lifelong learners who engage respectfully and compassionately with their communities\204both locally and globally. Above all, we want our students to grow into happy, fulfilled, and valued individuals.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

